## Documentation

Documentation lives in `docs/`. Build it with the applicable command below
before submitting documentation changes.
{%- if tasks == "tox" %}

```console
uvx tox -e docs
```
{%- elif tasks == "nox" %}

```console
uv run noxfile.py -s docs
```
{%- else %}

```console
uv run --group docs {{ "mkdocs" if docs == "mkdocs" else "zensical" }} build --strict
```
{%- endif %}
